---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="Affiliate Disclosure" description="How BostonVentures earns money and how affiliate links work.">
  <div class="wrap max-w-3xl py-12 prose-bv">
    <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold text-navy">Affiliate Disclosure</h1>
    <p class="text-sm text-ink/50">Last updated: November 2026</p>
    <p>BostonVentures is free to use. To keep it that way, some links on this site are affiliate links. If you click one and book or buy something, I may earn a commission. You never pay more because of it.</p>
    <p>Current partners include USA Transfers (airport transfers) and Holafly (eSIMs). More may be added; they will always be listed here.</p>
    <p>Affiliate links never decide which hotels or tours I recommend, and they never change a score. Pages with affiliate links show a short notice. Sponsored videos and paid placements are always labeled.</p>
  </div>
</Base>
